# SNAPSHOT — tnls (SSH tunnel manager)

Last updated: 2026-10-09 (post-commit: MSVC build verified)
Status: MVP complete — full app links + runs on MSVC toolchain
Current phase: Phase 1 — MVP DONE (verification next: tauri dev e2e)
Toolchain: Node v24.14.0, npm 11.9.0, rustc 1.96.0 (VS2019 MSVC 14.29 verified, gnu default), OpenSSH_for_Windows_9.5p1

## Product

Desktop app (Tauri 2 + React + Rust) quản lý SSH tunnels: lưu profiles,
bật/tắt bằng UI, chạy nền qua system tray, không cần terminal mỗi tunnel.

## Architecture (chốt)

Tauri 2 / React+TS+Vite / Rust+Tokio / OpenSSH process / SQLite /
tracing / GitHub Actions. Xem chi tiết: docs/DESIGN.md.

